  "instructions": {
    "zh": "像在电脑旁给朋友演示自己的产品。自然、轻松、真诚地聊天，声音清晰，短句之间稍作停顿。不要广告播音腔，不要朗诵，不要夸张或刻意拖长尾音。",
    "en": "Speak as if showing a friend around a product on your laptop. Warm, relaxed, conversational and clear, with natural small pauses. No announcer voice, no sales pitch, no exaggerated emphasis. Medium pace."
